		(uuid "96ed00e9-9ea3-4ecb-9687-92d07b06fc09")
	)
	(text "Oscillator has a rated load capcitance\nof 10 pF. Pin capacitance is 5 pF and\n1cm of 6mil traces is 1 pF.\n10 pF = C_L/2 + (5+1) pF\n-> C_L = 8 pF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122.174 166.116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "984bd9eb-b9b0-457a-aeb1-c710f7cca4f5")
	)
	(text "Flexible GPIO pins shared with daughter card. One\npin designated as an input while the other is an\noutput. Can either be used for sleep, data interrupt\netc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 110.998 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9ceff06d-5a5c-4386-9295-46641c2ed4ff")
	)
	(text "STM32 embeds pullup/down resistors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.85 73.406 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b5fb0013-9d64-44bc-b767-10d918ae53da")
	)
	(text "Inverting level shifter chosen to prevent case\nwhen WS_5V is off but driving data from uC\ncausing damage to the LED. Need to invert timer"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.798 142.494 0)
